# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The purge clears the copy the tree resolves to instead
# of the retired one, so every acknowledged value on the owner is lost.
MODULE: NoKeyLostPurgeWipesResizedCopy
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the purge clears the resized copy instead of the old one
PERTURBS: ResizePurge

--- FIND
    /\ row' = [row EXCEPT ![T] = [s \in Shards |-> [k \in Keys |-> Absent]]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the wrong copy is purged.
    /\ row' = [row EXCEPT ![R] = [s \in Shards |-> [k \in Keys |-> Absent]]]
--- END
